# AhaPath frontend — environment

This app needs NO environment variables to run.

- API calls use the relative path `/api`, which Vite proxies to
  `http://localhost:3001` in dev (see `vite.config.ts`) and which the
  deployed host rewrites to the backend in production.
- `import.meta.env.DEV` (built-in) is the only env read, for a debug flag.

NEVER put secrets in `VITE_*` variables — Vite inlines them into the
browser bundle. `GEMINI_API_KEY` and `MONGODB_URI` live ONLY in
`backend/.env` (see `backend/.env.example`), which is git-ignored.
